    "tips": [
      {
        "id": "days-capitals",
        "title": "Siku huanza kwa herufi kubwa",
        "body": [
          "Siku za wiki huandikwa kwa herufi kubwa: **Monday**, **Tuesday**, **Wednesday**, **Thursday**, **Friday**, **Saturday**, **Sunday**.",
          "Tumia **on**: **on Monday** (Jumatatu). Wiki ya Kiingereza mara nyingi huanza **Monday**, kama Kiswahili, ingawa kalenda nyingine huanza **Sunday**."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "routine-verbs",
        "title": "Ratiba: “I wake up”, “she wakes up”",
        "body": [
          "Kwa mambo ya kila siku tumia kitenzi cha kawaida: **I wake up at six.** **I go to work.**",
          "Kwa yeye ongeza **-s**: **she works**, **he goes**, **she likes**. Baada ya **like** tumia **-ing**: **I like playing football.**"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "weather-it",
        "title": "Hali ya hewa huanza na “it”",
        "body": [
          "Kiingereza huhitaji kiima, hata kwa mvua: **It’s raining.** (Mvua inanyesha.) **It’s hot.** (Kuna joto.) **It’s cold.** (Kuna baridi.)",
          "Kuuliza: **How is the weather today?** (Hali ya hewa ikoje leo?)"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "culture": [
      {
        "title": "Wikendi",
        "body": ["Jumamosi na Jumapili kwa pamoja huitwa **the weekend**. Ijumaa jioni watu husema **Have a nice weekend!** (Wikendi njema!)"]
      }
    ]
